  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p>University graduation recognition in August 2026</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://daotao.ptit.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/2651-qd.pdf\">Decision No. 2650/QD-HV: Recognizing graduation for full-time undergraduate students of Cohort D22 &#8211; HCM Campus.</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://daotao.ptit.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/2651-qd.pdf\">Decision No. 2651/QD-HV: Recognizing graduation for full-time undergraduate students (completing outstanding subjects) &#8211; HCM Campus.</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://daotao.ptit.edu.vn/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/08/2651-qd.pdf\">Decision No. 2652/QD-HV: Recognizing graduation for distance learning undergraduate students (completing outstanding subjects) &#8211; HCM Campus.</a></p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>University graduation recognition in August 2026 Decision No. 2650/QD-HV: Recognizing graduation for full-time undergraduate students of Cohort D22 &#8211; HCM Campus. Decision No. 2651/QD-HV: Recognizing graduation for full-time undergraduate students (completing outstanding subjects) &#8211; HCM Campus. Decision No. 2652/QD-HV: Recognizing graduation for distance learning undergraduate students (completing outstanding subjects) &#8211; HCM Campus.</p>\n",
